script = ExtResource("1_6cgi2")
text = "v0.3.1
Features:
- Added a chapter select menu to the main menu after completing the game
- Added a \"current chapter\" text box to the main menu after completing the tutorial
- Added \"Send Feedback\" button to better faciliate people giving feedback
- Added ending counter to show how many endings one has seen - not fully functional yet

Bugs:
- Fixed scaling slider not adjusting properly
- Fixed progress tracking for post-game game modes
- Fixed achievement unlock functionality
- Fixed jumpscares in the menu (for real this time!)
- Fixed hour 3 cutscene not triggering


v0.3
Features:
- The game is now feature complete from beginning to the main ending

Bugs:
- Fixed an issue where custom mode start button wouldn't start the game
- Ensured you couldn't crash the game by not selecting mechanics before starting custom mode
- Fixed an issue where endless mode start button wouldn't start the game
- Fixed an issue allowing the player to halt quitting the game by right clicking while it closed

v0.26.4
- fixed an issue caused by 0.26.2
- slight volume adjustment to rain VFX to make it easier for non-headphone players

v0.26.3
- Slight difficulty adjustments

v0.26.2:
Features
- Added the dialogue that says \\\"turn the light on and find me\\\" back into the tutorial

Bugs
- (Hopefully) fixed an issue allowing the jumpscare to play in the menu (again)
- Fixed a lot of input management issues, should no longer be able to spam right click and cause problems
- Fixed potential crashes caused by spamming right click at certain points

v0.26.1:
- Fixed a few issues with the new tutorial

v0.26:
Major Changes:
- New tutorial

Minor Changes:
- Visual: Added particle effects to a few different things
- Settings: Added tooltips to the window and performance settings, added new \\\"emitters\\\" button which turns particles on or off

v0.25.3:
- Added stats
- Achievement unlocks (doesn't work in the playtest mode currently)
- Changed some default settings

v0.25.2:
- Going back to the main menu will now properly adjust your game progress

v0.25.1:
- The shadow shouldn't be able to kill you in the menus anymore (sorry drew lol)
- The shadow shouldn't be able to kill you in the tutorial anymore (also sorry drew lol)
- Fixed more pausability issues
- Fixed control handling during certain events

v0.24:
	- Fixed audio firing multiple times in settings menu

v0.23:
	- Pause menu now properly pauses the game

v0.22:
	- Added the text box you are currently looking at"
metadata/_custom_type_script = "uid://dcuepukutdxbq"
